ing dataset .Compared with sequence - level GLUE tasks , the question answering tasks depends on more subtle knowledge to infer the correct answer , which increases the difficulty of knowledge distillation .Initializing general TinyBERT with BERT SMALL is a straightforward idea .However , BERT SMALL would derive mismatched distributions in intermediate representations ( e.g. , attention matrices and hidden states ) with the teacher BERT BASE model , if without imitating the teacher 's behaviors at the pre - training stage .Further
